 .TP
+On illumos, Option "HotplugPoll" "false" disables the bounded connector-status
+polling fallback. By default external outputs are checked every three seconds,
+or five seconds when the DRM sysevent subscription is available. Failed queries
+back off to thirty seconds. Fixed panels are not forcibly probed. Resource
+snapshots are limited to 128 connectors, with four connectors per timer batch.
+A single kernel ioctl cannot be preempted by this userspace budget.
+Polling pauses while the screen does not own the VT. Sysevent notifications
+remain enabled independently; both paths reconcile dynamic MST connectors.
+.PP
